    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1145">

                <pb facs="1060" n="802" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg802"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-01T15:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 1, 1915, 3 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 9.25 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>385. Your August 30, 5 p. m., received from Berne. Italian Government last autumn
                    placed embargo on arms and ammunition with other commodities simply because they
                    were needed for Italy herself. They recognize right under Hague convention to
                    sell arms to belligerents.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
